@startuml
skin rose
title Вариант 2: Прямой SMTP-диалог с MailHog

actor User as "Пользователь"
participant SMTPClient as "SMTP-клиент\n(swaks/telnet/nc)"
participant SMTP as "MailHog SMTP\n:1025"
participant UI as "MailHog Web UI\n:8025"

User -> SMTPClient: Запускает SMTP-сессию
SMTPClient -> SMTP: TCP connect :1025
SMTP --> SMTPClient: 220 Service ready

SMTPClient -> SMTP: EHLO demo.local
SMTP --> SMTPClient: 250 OK (+ capabilities)

SMTPClient -> SMTP: MAIL FROM:<demo@local>
SMTP --> SMTPClient: 250 OK

SMTPClient -> SMTP: RCPT TO:<student@example.com>
SMTP --> SMTPClient: 250 OK

SMTPClient -> SMTP: DATA
SMTP --> SMTPClient: 354 End data with <CRLF>.<CRLF>

SMTPClient -> SMTP: Subject/Body + "." (end)
SMTP --> SMTPClient: 250 Queued

SMTPClient -> SMTP: QUIT
SMTP --> SMTPClient: 221 Bye

User -> UI: Открывает MailHog UI
UI --> User: Видит отправленное письмо

@enduml